WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.891 --> 00:00:18.332
Ally thought, watching Dawn's angry face.

2
00:00:18.352 --> 00:00:21.894
"I'd better do something to restore the peace!"

3
00:00:22.415 --> 00:00:24.496
She jumped up and cleared away some dishes.

4
00:00:25.816 --> 00:00:27.157
Then she pulled out Alpha.

5
00:00:27.177 --> 00:00:31.239
"Play a love song for Ray and Dawn, Alpha!

6
00:00:31.720 --> 00:00:36.467
Fast!" Instead, Alpha started blaring Ally's morning wake-up music.

7
00:00:36.487 --> 00:00:37.768
"Not this!"

8
00:00:38.108 --> 00:00:38.748
Ally whispered.

9
00:00:38.768 --> 00:00:42.211
"A love song—one that's good for slow dancing!"

10
00:00:42.231 --> 00:00:44.712
"Affirmative," Alpha said.

11
00:00:46.173 --> 00:00:48.455
But then she started playing a news station.

12
00:00:48.475 --> 00:00:51.837
"Ugh!" Ally fumbled to switch off Alpha.

13
00:00:52.778 --> 00:00:55.259
Dawn uncrossed her arms and glared at Ray.

14
00:00:55.279 --> 00:00:59.222
"You said you were considering moving to the city.

15
00:00:59.242 --> 00:01:01.724
So why did you go and buy a food truck?"

16
00:01:02.568 --> 00:01:04.209
Ray ran his fingers through his hair.

17
00:01:04.229 --> 00:01:06.270
"I did consider the move, Dawn.

18
00:01:06.850 --> 00:01:07.651
Long and hard.

19
00:01:08.391 --> 00:01:11.633
But the diner is doing great, and this is where my life is.

20
00:01:12.894 --> 00:01:13.474
I'm sorry.

21
00:01:13.954 --> 00:01:15.215
I don't want to move to the city."

22
00:01:17.116 --> 00:01:18.036
Dawn looked upset.

23
00:01:18.817 --> 00:01:20.878
But finally she let out a deep sigh.

24
00:01:20.898 --> 00:01:26.521
"I understand, even though it does make me sad.

25
00:01:27.001 --> 00:01:28.882
Mateo and I will miss you very much."

26
00:01:30.223 --> 00:01:31.644
Mateo's eyes went wide.

27
00:01:32.788 --> 00:01:36.790
"Um He nervously cleared his throat.

28
00:01:36.810 --> 00:01:40.932
"Sorry, Mom, but I don't want to move either.

29
00:01:42.232 --> 00:01:48.375
All my friends are here, my school, my soccer camp Dawn bit her lip.

30
00:01:48.395 --> 00:01:52.196
"Well, my fashion design business is in the city.

31
00:01:53.297 --> 00:01:54.337
I can't give it up now."

32
00:01:55.798 --> 00:01:58.619
Ally looked from Dawn to Ray to Mateo.

33
00:01:59.379 --> 00:02:01.000
The family was at an impasse.

34
00:02:02.288 --> 00:02:05.589
Ally had to do something to bring them together—and quickly.

35
00:02:08.571 --> 00:02:09.531
She sat down again.

36
00:02:09.551 --> 00:02:13.333
"Dawn, what if your new career could be here?"

37
00:02:14.353 --> 00:02:15.233
Dawn shook her head.

38
00:02:16.054 --> 00:02:17.594
"Sandville is a small town.

39
00:02:18.615 --> 00:02:21.256
The city is the best place for a fashion designer."

40
00:02:21.276 --> 00:02:25.177
"You could open a clothing store here," Ally said.

41
00:02:25.197 --> 00:02:28.859
"Kate is always saying this town needs a fashion upgrade."

42
00:02:28.879 --> 00:02:32.372
"That's a great idea," Ray said.

43
00:02:36.654 --> 00:02:38.795
not bad," Dawn said slowly.

44
00:02:38.815 --> 00:02:40.216
"I'll think about it."

45
00:02:45.958 --> 00:02:50.680
The next morning Ally and Mateo went outside to wait for Lainie Polk's car to take them to

46
00:02:50.720 --> 00:02:51.460
the P.O.D.

47
00:02:51.480 --> 00:02:54.902
"Thanks for coming with me, Mateo," Ally said.

48
00:02:54.922 --> 00:02:59.904
"I'm sure Lainie is nice, but I feel better knowing you'll be with me today."

49
00:03:01.016 --> 00:03:02.778
"This way I'll get to see the P.O.D.

50
00:03:02.838 --> 00:03:08.442
too. That's almost as good as traveling on it," Mateo said as a dark car pulled up.

51
00:03:11.925 --> 00:03:13.586
Ally climbed into the car first.

52
00:03:14.827 --> 00:03:19.912
She looked over at the other backseat passenger, eager to finally meet the mysterious billionaire.

53
00:03:24.735 --> 00:03:25.476
Ally burst out.

54
00:03:25.496 --> 00:03:27.818
"You're Lainie Polk?"

55
00:03:28.439 --> 00:03:32.245
It was the customer from the diner, the woman who might be a Carparian!

56
00:03:32.265 --> 00:03:36.426
"Yep!" Lainie laughed.

57
00:03:37.766 --> 00:03:38.887
Ally swallowed hard.

58
00:03:39.487 --> 00:03:43.348
If Lainie was a Carparian, she probably knew Ally was an Astralian.

59
00:03:44.308 --> 00:03:45.949
That meant she could have told Dr.

60
00:03:46.009 --> 00:03:47.409
Lloyd where to find Ally!

61
00:03:47.429 --> 00:03:51.770
"I, uh, think I left something in the house."

62
00:03:52.431 --> 00:03:56.772
Ally started to climb out of the car, but the driver had come around to shut the door.

63
00:03:58.156 --> 00:04:00.938
"Sorry, we don't have all day," Lainie said.

64
00:04:00.958 --> 00:04:02.719
"We have a P.O.D.

65
00:04:02.759 --> 00:04:04.179
to launch in two days!"

66
00:04:04.199 --> 00:04:06.060
"Wait!" Ally said.

67
00:04:06.080 --> 00:04:08.021
"My friend Mateo is coming too."

68
00:04:08.041 --> 00:04:12.164
"Nope, this is top secret," Lainie said firmly.

69
00:04:12.184 --> 00:04:15.005
"Nobody else can know where the launch site is."

70
00:04:17.266 --> 00:04:22.669
As the car zoomed toward the desert, Ally tried to read Lainie's mind, but she couldn't get anything.

71
00:04:25.831 --> 00:04:27.612
Lainie smiled mischievously at her.

72
00:04:28.532 --> 00:04:31.515
"We're going to have quite an adventure in space.

73
00:04:32.195 --> 00:04:33.697
What did you say the other day?

74
00:04:34.097 --> 00:04:36.479
You can't wait to get back there?"

75
00:04:36.499 --> 00:04:39.282
"Yeah, silly me!

76
00:04:39.882 --> 00:04:41.844
Always joking around!"

77
00:04:43.085 --> 00:04:44.166
Ally faked a smile.

78
00:04:44.186 --> 00:04:46.689
"I have to find a way to escape!"

79
00:04:47.049 --> 00:04:47.469
she thought.

80
00:04:47.489 --> 00:04:49.831
"I could be in real danger!"

81
00:04:51.913 --> 00:04:54.576
As the car approached the desert, it slowed down.

82
00:04:55.760 --> 00:04:58.821
Ally looked out the window and saw people blocking the road.

83
00:04:58.841 --> 00:05:03.223
"What are all these people doing here?"

84
00:05:03.683 --> 00:05:04.364
Lainie murmured.

85
00:05:04.384 --> 00:05:08.585
"Someone probably leaked the location of my P.O.D."

86
00:05:09.826 --> 00:05:14.928
As the car crawled along, people started shouting, "Watch out for the whoopers!"

87
00:05:14.948 --> 00:05:20.010
"Oh!" Lainie laughed in relief.

88
00:05:20.030 --> 00:05:22.711
"They haven't found my launch site!

89
00:05:23.231 --> 00:05:24.952
They're just looking for birds."

90
00:05:25.596 --> 00:05:26.377
She shook her head.

91
00:05:26.397 --> 00:05:29.298
"I'll make a big donation to them.

92
00:05:29.739 --> 00:05:34.942
They can build some birdhouses or something, but they should know by now that the future is in

93
00:05:35.102 --> 00:05:38.504
space." "How can you say that?"

94
00:05:38.884 --> 00:05:41.926
Ally cried, suddenly forgetting to be scared of Lainie.

95
00:05:41.946 --> 00:05:44.648
"All life, everywhere, is important!"

96
00:05:46.209 --> 00:05:50.932
Lainie laughed loudly and shook her head.

97
00:05:52.352 --> 00:05:57.215
"The next thing you're going to tell me is that all people should learn to get along, right?"

98
00:05:59.156 --> 00:05:59.937
Ally gasped.

99
00:06:00.657 --> 00:06:03.439
"That's exactly what a Carparian would say!"

100
00:06:03.939 --> 00:06:04.360
she thought.
